var e=[{id:`n_1`,type:`scene_change`,speaker:null,text:null,stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:null,R:null}}},{id:`n_2`,type:`dialog`,speaker:`CRAFTER_NANAHARA_NULL_NULL`,text:{KOREA:`어째서 관리국에 남기로 했냐고? 과거를 기억하고 책임지는 건 비단 젊은이들만의 몫이 아니거든. 먼저 떠나간 제자들 체면 구기지 않게... 이 볼품없는 스승이라도 열심히 해야지.`,JPN:`なぜ管理局に残ろうと思ったかって？　過去を記憶して責任を取るのは単に若者だけの役割ではないのじゃ。先にこの世を去った弟子たちの体裁を守るためにも…こんな無様な師匠でも頑張らなきゃならん。`,ENG:`Why did I choose to remain at the Administration? Remembering the past is a duty that extends beyond just the younger generation. To avoid disappointing my apprentices who have fallen before me... I must put in more effort as their mentor.`,TWN:`我為何決定留在管理局嗎？因為回憶過去負起責任並非只是年輕人的事。我這個不成材的師父當然也要好好努力…不能讓先走一步的徒弟們丟臉的嘛。`},stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:{char_id:`CRAFTER_NANAHARA_NULL_NULL`,face:`UNIT_IDLE`,hologram:!1},R:null}}}];export{e as default};